# The build context is the repo root (pnpm workspace: the lockfile and every sibling package have to
# be reachable), which means everything not excluded here is copied into a build layer.

# Credentials must never enter an image layer. `.baron/credentials` is gitignored, so it is invisible
# to `git ls-files` but very much present in a working checkout — and a layer keeps it even if a
# later step deletes the file. The committed `.baron/policy.json` is deliberately NOT excluded: it is
# policy only, and it is what lets the server start and answer an introspection exchange.
.baron/credentials
**/.baron/credentials
*.env
.env*

# Rebuilt inside the image; copying host artifacts risks a stale or platform-wrong binary.
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
.git

# Nothing the server needs at build or run time.
.github
docs
examples
**/*.test.ts
**/*.md
!README.md
